{"status":"ok","message-type":"work","message-version":"1.0.0","message":{"indexed":{"date-parts":[[2026,8,13]],"date-time":"2026-08-13T11:27:15Z","timestamp":1786620435451,"version":"build-2736575974"},"posted":{"date-parts":[[2020]]},"group-title":"SSRN","reference-count":0,"publisher":"Elsevier BV","content-domain":{"domain":[],"crossmark-restriction":false},"short-container-title":[],"abstract":"<jats:p>The importance of object detection is paramount to visual perception. Shape recognition plays a key role in object detection. An object may comprise multiple faces and edges, however, to the straight line of vision, the first thing that is perceived of the object is the shape of the face. This paper formulates a code implementing the OpenCV (Open Source Computer Vision) library in Python, to identify shapes and its colors in a given binary image. It involves functions for processing images, loading them and identifying various shapes and colors in the given sample image.<\/jats:p>","DOI":"10.2139\/ssrn.3693147","type":"posted-content","created":{"date-parts":[[2020,11,5]],"date-time":"2020-11-05T09:19:54Z","timestamp":1604567994000},"source":"Crossref","is-referenced-by-count":0,"title":["An Algorithm on Shape and Colour Recognition Using OpenCV"],"prefix":"10.2139","author":[{"ORCID":"https:\/\/orcid.org\/0000-0002-8657-8975","authenticated-orcid":true,"given":"Sanat","family":"Madkar","sequence":"first","affiliation":[],"role":[{"vocabulary":"crossref","role":"author"}]},{"given":"Tanay","family":"Maheshwari","sequence":"additional","affiliation":[],"role":[{"vocabulary":"crossref","role":"author"}]},{"given":"Rahil","family":"Merchant","sequence":"additional","affiliation":[],"role":[{"vocabulary":"crossref","role":"author"}]},{"given":"Mann","family":"Merani","sequence":"additional","affiliation":[],"role":[{"vocabulary":"crossref","role":"author"}]}],"member":"78","container-title":[],"original-title":[],"deposited":{"date-parts":[[2026,8,13]],"date-time":"2